{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b","name":"Ranged Attacks","source":{"id":"source:reference-3c89b302f9fd687b","title":"Ranged Attacks","revision":18433,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:07:26Z","sha256":"0519b0bc385c46affa04fa18699854cc686ee6cc4020a5c26e824595e35cfa20","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18433","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ranged%20Attacks&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3c89b302f9fd687b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With a ranged weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can throw or shoot at any target within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," if there are no obstructions (including other characters) between you and the target. The maximum Range of a ranged weapon depends on the weapon used.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ranged Attack: 1d20 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Modifier + Range Modifier"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"},":"]}," Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"}," and level determine your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Modifier:"]}," Since ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," measures coordination and steadiness, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier applies to attacks with ranged weapons."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Range Modifier:"]}," A ranged weapon can attack a target at Point-Blank, Short, Medium, or Long Range. If you make a ranged attack against a target within the weapon's Point-Blank Range, you take no penalty on the attack roll; your penalty on attack rolls increases to\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["-2 at Short Range,"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["-5 at Medium Range,"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["and -10 at Long Range."]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ranged Damage: Weapon Dice + One-Half Heroic Level (Rounded Down)"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Weapon Dice:"]}," A hit always deals at least 1 point of damage, even if penalties to damage bring the damage result below 1."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["One-Half Heroic Level:"]}," Weapons are simply more dangerous in the hands of powerful heroes (and villains).\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Beasts add half their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," Level (rounded down) to damage rolls made with Natural Weapons."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Special:"]}," When you hit with a Thrown Weapon, you add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier to damage."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicle Combat"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["With a ranged weapon, you can throw or shoot at any target within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},", as long as your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," does not grant you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Cover"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," modifiers apply normally for your weapon). You cannot make a personal ranged attack in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},", except within the confines of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you occupy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"}," can fire their blasters at targets outside a ",{"tag":"a","children":["LAAT/i Gunship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/LAAT/i_Gunship","referenceId":"reference:4ec307279de7b7a7"},", as long as the ship's doors are open.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Mass Combat"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["All ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," and Ranged Attacks if they possess the appropriate weaponry. Apply the bonuses to the attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of the target, as normal. A Battalion's attack bonuses are listed in its statistics blocks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can make Ranged Attacks against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," within its weapons' Ranges.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEAPON TYPE\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STARSHIP SCALE RANGE\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2-3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"},{"tag":"sup","children":["1"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},{"tag":"sup","children":["1"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Thrown Weapons",{"tag":"sup","children":["2"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["1: This weapon can be used only at Point-Blank or Long Range."]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["2: This weapon can be used only at Point-Blank Range."]}]},"\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Range"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["All ranged weapons apply the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier to the attack roll. Ranged attacks made at Point-Blank Range suffer no penalty. However, Ranged Attacks made at Short, Medium, or Long Range take a penalty on the attack roll, as presented in the below table.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RANGED WEAPON TYPE\n"],"rowspan":3},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RANGE CATEGORIES\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NO PENALTY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["-2 PENALTY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["-5 PENALTY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["-10 PENALTY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0-50 squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["51-100 squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["101-250 squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["251-500 squares\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols