tag":"i","children":["2: Includes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improvised Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improvised_Weapons"}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Point-Blank Shot, Rangefinders, and Targeting Scopes"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Under most circumstances, a character with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"}," Feat receives a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls only when the target is within his or her weapon's Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," does not change how far your target is from you, so taking an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"}," to attack a target that is 50 squares away does not give you the +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls that you would receive if the target were within 30 squares. This is the same for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rangefinder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rangefinder","referenceId":"reference:b9f8f98f87db41c9"}," upgrade, which negates the penalty for attacking a target that is at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Attacking into a Melee"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you shoot a ranged weapon or throw a weapon at an opponent that is adjacent to one or more of your allies, you take a -5 penalty on your attack roll. This penalty accounts for the fact that you're trying not to hit your allies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Precise Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Precise_Shot","referenceId":"reference:22a4f5aa2c7ad54d"}," feat, you don't take this penalty.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
